# Production build environment.
#
# VITE_*-prefixed values are inlined into the client bundle at build time.
# The Clerk *publishable* key (pk_...) is public by design — every Clerk app ships it —
# so committing it here is intentional, and it is what lets `vercel --prod` authenticate
# without anyone setting env vars in the dashboard.
#
# The *secret* key (sk_...) must never appear in this file, in any VITE_ variable, or in src/.

VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_aGlwLWNhdC03MDE4LmNsZXJrLmFjY291bnRzLmRldiQ
